        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beton Gardens is a city ruled by the POPEGOD corporation. this is in large part due to their control of the city’s railway system, which is its only reliable source of transport.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a city of concrete, tower blocks, empty roads, and train stations, <strong><i>where entire trains full of people have started to disappear daily....</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you play as Marzipan, a nurse at Beton Gardens Hospital. who together with her best friend Burgundy, will find themselves at the center of these disappearances. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>welcome to BETON GARDENS...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LOST IN TRANSIT is a narrative, story heavy horror game made in RPG Maker 2003.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >top down explorable areas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >first person menu driven segments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >pre-renders, hand drawn art, and sprite art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a mystery to uncover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >snailo</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >game by thorhighheels with music &amp; sound effects by thorhighheels &amp; girls@computers </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >additional spritework also by girls@computers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >originally made for the Coolt Halloween Game Jam 2025</p>",
